{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05816","headline":"和从叔禄愔元日早朝 · 李元操","name":"和从叔禄愔元日早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜浑变秋节，玉律动年灰。\n暧暧城霞旦，隐隐禁门开。\n衆灵凑仙府，百神朝帝台。\n叶令双凫至，梁王驷马来。\n戈鋋映林阙，歌管拂尘埃。\n保章望瑞气，尚书免火灾。\n冠冕多秀士，簪裾饶上才。\n谁怜张仲蔚，日暮反蒿莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李元操","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}